, "keywords": ["drone", "factory", "automation", "engineering"], "long_description": "Experience the power of modern industrial automation in this immersive VR simulation. Witness the precise, step-by-step assembly of an advanced VTOL (Vertical Take-Off and Landing) drone on a fully automated, moving production line. Designed for robotics enthusiasts, engineers, and tech tech-heads, this experience puts you front and center of a next-generation manufacturing ecosystem.\n\nWith a simple start/stop interface, you can control the line and closely observe how complex machinery coordinates to build high-performance aerial tech from the ground up.\n\nKey Features:\nAdvanced Robotics Ecosystem: Observe high-fidelity UR10 collaborative arms and rapid SCARA robots working in perfect synchronization to handle, position, and secure components.\n\nSmart Factory Automation: Track the flow of a modern, moving assembly line optimized for maximum manufacturing efficiency.\n\nDetailed VTOL Assembly: Watch the intricate mechanical layout of a drone come together, from structural framing to internal components.\n\nEngineering Perspective: Get a close-up, unrestricted look at industrial robotics in action\u2014an ideal simulation for anyone fascinated by automation, kinematics, and smart manufacturing.\n\nControl the line and see the future of automated drone manufacturing today.", "short_description": "A relaxing VR simulation of automated VTOL drone assembly and robotics."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://vmlafrica.org/docs/Virtual%20Mechatronics%20Lab.pdf", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Virtual Mechatronic Lab", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://vmlafrica.org/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_FEW", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}, {"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_sub